    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "gym_esper_040_receptionist_00",
      "hash64": "1F919632251A1EC8",
      "text": "Bonjour et bienvenue à l’Arène d’Alforneira !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "gym_esper_040_receptionist_01",
      "hash64": "1F919732251A207B",
      "text": "La Championne vous attend ! Êtes-vous prêt[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e à\\naffronter Tully, la Kinésiste Cosmétique ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "gym_esper_040_receptionist_02",
      "hash64": "1F919832251A222E",
      "text": "Entendu. Laissez-moi vous guider jusqu’au\\nterrain de combat.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "gym_esper_040_receptionist_03",
      "hash64": "1F919932251A23E1",
      "text": "Revenez me voir quand vous aurez terminé\\nvos préparatifs.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "gym_esper_040_esper_entry_01",
      "hash64": "EA01E71F5103C776",
      "text": "Hmmm, je vois... Laisse-moi m’occuper\\nde tout ça.[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 49,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "gym_esper_040_esper_entry_02",
      "hash64": "EA01E61F5103C5C3",
      "text": "Je propose de partir sur un slogan simple et\\ncatchy : « La beauté au naturel ».[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "gym_esper_040_esper_entry_03",
      "hash64": "EA01E51F5103C410",
      "text": "Peux-tu gérer la commande des nouvelles\\ncouleurs d’ombre à paupières ?[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "gym_esper_040_esper_entry_04",
      "hash64": "EA01EC1F5103CFF5",
      "text": "... Merci, je peux vraiment compter sur toi.\\nJe dois te laisser. Bye ![VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "gym_esper_040_esper_01",
      "hash64": "A1A3806506F21EE3",
      "text": "Bonjour à toi ![VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "gym_esper_040_esper_02",
      "hash64": "A1A3816506F22096",
      "text": "Je suis Tully, la Championne de cette Arène.\\nJe suis aussi créatrice de tendances,\\r\\net ma spécialité, c’est le maquillage.[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 124,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "gym_esper_040_esper_03",
      "hash64": "A1A3826506F22249",
      "text": "Élige n’a pas tari d’éloges à ton sujet. Elle m’a\\ndit que tu étais absolument fabuleu[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0201)]xse.[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0201"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "gym_esper_040_esper_04",
      "hash64": "A1A3836506F223FC",
      "text": "Pour tout te dire, je ne m’attendais pas à ce que\\ntu sois aussi adorable.[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "gym_esper_040_esper_05",
      "hash64": "A1A3846506F225AF",
      "text": "As-tu apprécié mon programme de fitness ?\\c\\nSi je l’ai créé, c’est pour sublimer la beauté\\nintérieure ! Et je vois que tu rayonnes ![VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 133,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "gym_esper_040_esper_06",
      "hash64": "A1A3856506F22762",
      "text": "Je note d’ailleurs que tu sembles prendre soin\\nde l’apparence de t[VAR 0x1101(00FD,0202)]ones Pokémon.\\c\\nJ’aime ton sens de l’esthétisme.[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
